{"schema_version":"1.9.2","id":"ALSA-2026:98629","published":"2026-11-11T00:00:00Z","modified":"2026-11-16T18:00:24.652372330Z","related":["CVE-2026-69184","CVE-2026-69186"],"upstream":["CVE-2026-69184","CVE-2026-69186"],"summary":"Important: c-ares security update","details":"The c-ares C library defines asynchronous DNS (Domain Name System) requests and provides name resolving API.  \n\nSecurity Fix(es):  \n\n  * c-ares: c-ares: Denial of Service via unvalidated DNS header record counts (CVE-2026-69186)\n  * c-ares: c-ares: CPU exhaustion denial of service via unbounded DNS name compression pointer chains (CVE-2026-69184)\n\n\nFor more details about the security issue(s), including the impact, a CVSS score, acknowledgments, and other related information, refer to the CVE page(s) listed in the References section.\n","affected":[{"package":{"name":"c-ares","ecosystem":"AlmaLinux:10","purl":"pkg:rpm/almalinux/c-ares"},"ranges":[{"type":"ECOSYSTEM","events":[{"introduced":"0"},{"fixed":"1.34.6-5.el10_3.2"}]}],"database_specific":{"source":"https://github.com/AlmaLinux/osv-database/blob/master/advisories/almalinux10/ALSA-2026:98629.json"}},{"package":{"name":"c-ares-devel","ecosystem":"AlmaLinux:10","purl":"pkg:rpm/almalinux/c-ares-devel"},"ranges":[{"type":"ECOSYSTEM","events":[{"introduced":"0"},{"fixed":"1.34.6-5.el10_3.2"}]}],"database_specific":{"source":"https://github.com/AlmaLinux/osv-database/blob/master/advisories/almalinux10/ALSA-2026:98629.json"}}],"references":[{"type":"ADVISORY","url":"https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2026:98629"},{"type":"REPORT","url":"https://access.redhat.com/security/cve/CVE-2026-69184"},{"type":"REPORT","url":"https://access.redhat.com/security/cve/CVE-2026-69186"},{"type":"REPORT","url":"https://bugzilla.redhat.com/2538212"},{"type":"REPORT","url":"https://bugzilla.redhat.com/2538396"},{"type":"ADVISORY","url":"https://errata.almalinux.org/10/ALSA-2026-98629.html"}]}